      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹3.85 (vs ₹5.16 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.85 (down from ₹5.16 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹34.8b (up 1.7% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.14b (down 25% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.3% (down from 4.5% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 26% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 24% per year.",
